<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Silicon Gaming.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Silicon Gaming.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns initiated coverage of Silicon Gaming Corp with a buy recommendation, according to the office of analyst Jason Ader, confirming an earlier item attributed to a Bear Stearns source.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 7/16 to 9-3/8 in early Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
